  "limitations": [
    "Understanding of how mood influences productivity is weak and often overshadowed by other factors.",
    "Effects of windows on mood and task performance may be small and short-lived due to habituation and other influences.",
    "Some studies on daylighting in schools have methodological faults and analytical flaws, making their conclusions unreliable."
  ]
